{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30345","headline":"送僧归庐山 · 赵嘏","name":"送僧归庐山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禅栖忽忆五峰游，去着方袍谢列侯。\n经啓楼台千叶曙，锡含风雨一枝秋。\n题诗片石侵云在，洗鉢香泉覆菊流。\n却忆前年别师处，马嘶残月虎溪头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}